**The result must feel like a polished Vietnamese Student Association management system — NOT an AI dashboard, developer console, ERP configuration tool or workflow-engine demonstration.**

Keep the visual design modern and premium.

Do not return to the outdated legacy table styling.

Simplify the language, information hierarchy and interaction patterns.

Preserve all legitimate business functionality.

